      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 650240635,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Having this functionality would be great, as an aid for properly analyzing exported PCAP files. The current workaround that I am using is generating two .JSON files from the original .PCAP: One JSON file contains the \"truly\" desired fields, the other one contains just the frame number and _ws.col data. Merging the two .JSONs solve the problem, but wastes time and effort. Adding this functionality into tshark would eliminate that cumbersome process!",
