          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "> Fill in column fields for internal use when not being printed or required by a tap.\n\nWhen used by a dissector, or when used by something else?\n\n> (see Lua pinfo.columns/pinfo.cols)\n\nOr `pinfo->info` in C dissectors.\n\nBut where would the column data be used in this case?",
