        {
          "id": 850373037,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "[filtcols: A post-dissector to allow filtering on Protocol and Info columns](https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/wikis/Lua/Examples/filtcols)  \n  \n**Why is pinfo.cols returning an empty value?**  \n\ntshark has special magical incantations for whether or not it populates the cinfo that Lua pulls pinfo.cols data from. There is an open merge request (2473: tshark: add --columns option) to add an option to explicitly create the column data.  \n  \nI think the empty values were found when trying to get the `filtcols` to work with `tshark`:  \n[Tshark LUA Script](https://ask.wireshark.org/question/21374/tshark-lua-script/)",
